    {
      "kind": "step",
      "ings": [],
      "body": "Return the roast and its juices. Braise in the oven, turning every 30 min, until fork-tender but still holding together, <span class=\"rc-nw\">3½–4 h</span>. For slicing, don’t let it fall apart."
    },
    {
